<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26522" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διέκ-πλοος</span></b> , 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διέκπλους</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>passage,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν βραχέων</span>
			<i>through</i> the shallows, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.179
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ὑπόφαυσιν καταλιπεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.36
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Criti.</u>
				115e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>breaking the enemy's line</i> in a sea-fight, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ποιεύμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.36
			</span></i>.</div>
